  <h1>Beef Jerky Seasoning — Homemade Blends & Complete Guide</h1>

  <div class="answer-box">
    <p>The foundation of great beef jerky seasoning is simple: salt (1–1.5 tsp per lb), black pepper, garlic powder, and onion powder. Add soy sauce and Worcestershire for umami depth, then layer heat or sweetness based on your target flavor. The salt ratio is non-negotiable — everything else is customizable.</p>
  </div>

